## State Machine Transaksi (Rencana)

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending: User klik "Pilih Paket"
    
    pending --> settlement: Midtrans webhook (bayar sukses)
    pending --> cancelled: User klik "Batalkan" + API cancel Midtrans
    pending --> expired: Midtrans webhook (batas waktu habis)
    pending --> failed: Midtrans webhook (deny/failure)
    pending --> pending: User klik "Lanjutkan Pembayaran" (re-open Snap)
    
    settlement --> [*]: Terminal (Kuota sudah diproses)
    cancelled --> [*]: Terminal
    expired --> [*]: Terminal
    failed --> [*]: Terminal
```

