## Proposed Changes

### Database Schema

#### [MODIFY] [add_transactions_table.sql](file:///d:/KULIAH/SEMESTER%207/Skripsi/Moderasi%20Judol%20V1/web-app/database/add_transactions_table.sql)

Perubahan pada tabel `transactions`:

```diff
 CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.transactions (
   id             TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
   user_email     TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES public.user_profiles(email) ON DELETE CASCADE,
   package_id     TEXT NOT NULL,
+  transaction_type TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'subscription',  -- 'subscription' | 'topup'
   amount         INTEGER NOT NULL,
   quota_units    INTEGER NOT NULL,
   target_tier    TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'FREE',
   duration_days  INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
-  status         TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending',
+  status         TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending'
+                  CHECK (status IN ('pending','settlement','cancelled','expired','failed')),
   snap_token     TEXT,
+  snap_redirect_url TEXT,                                -- URL fallback jika Snap popup gagal
+  midtrans_payment_type TEXT,                            -- 'bank_transfer', 'gopay', 'credit_card', dll
+  paid_at        TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NULL,               -- Waktu pembayaran berhasil
+  cancelled_at   TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NULL,               -- Waktu user membatalkan
+  expired_at     TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NULL,               -- Waktu kedaluwarsa otomatis
   created_at     TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now(),
   updated_at     TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT now()
 );
```

**Kolom baru:**
| Kolom | Tipe | Tujuan |
|-------|------|--------|
| `transaction_type` | TEXT | Membedakan 'subscription' vs 'topup' secara eksplisit |
| `status` CHECK constraint | — | Validasi status di level DB, mencegah typo |
| `snap_redirect_url` | TEXT | URL redirect jika Snap popup tidak bisa digunakan |
| `midtrans_payment_type` | TEXT | Mencatat metode pembayaran yang digunakan |
| `paid_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamp pembayaran sukses |
| `cancelled_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamp pembatalan manual |
| `expired_at` | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamp kedaluwarsa otomatis |

#### [NEW] [migration_transactions_v2.sql](file:///d:/KULIAH/SEMESTER%207/Skripsi/Moderasi%20Judol%20V1/web-app/database/migration_transactions_v2.sql)

Skrip migrasi untuk:
1. ALTER TABLE menambah kolom baru
2. Migrasi data lama: isi `transaction_type` berdasarkan `duration_days`
3. Normalisasi status: `expire` → `expired`, `cancel` → `cancelled`
4. Backfill `paid_at` dari `updated_at` untuk transaksi `settlement`
5. Auto-expire transaksi pending > 24 jam (opsional)

