#### [NEW] [cancel/route.js](file:///d:/KULIAH/SEMESTER%207/Skripsi/Moderasi%20Judol%20V1/web-app/app/api/payment/cancel/route.js)

Endpoint baru `POST /api/payment/cancel`:
1. Validasi user ownership (session email = transaction user_email)
2. Validasi status transaksi = `pending` (hanya pending yang bisa dibatalkan)
3. Panggil Midtrans Cancel API: `POST https://api.sandbox.midtrans.com/v2/{order_id}/cancel`
4. Update status di DB menjadi `cancelled` + set `cancelled_at`
5. Return sukses ke frontend

#### [NEW] [status/route.js](file:///d:/KULIAH/SEMESTER%207/Skripsi/Moderasi%20Judol%20V1/web-app/app/api/payment/status/route.js)

Endpoint baru `GET /api/payment/status?order_id=XXX`:
1. Cek status transaksi terkini langsung ke Midtrans API: `GET https://api.sandbox.midtrans.com/v2/{order_id}/status`
2. Sinkronisasi status DB jika berbeda dengan status Midtrans
3. Return status terbaru + snap_token (untuk resume payment)

